  <Docs>
    <summary>Represents the configuration for a raw ranging session initiated by a responder device.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents the configuration for a raw ranging session initiated by a responder device.
            This class holds a <c>android.ranging.raw.RawRangingDevice</c> object that participates in the
            session.</para>
